    <briefdescription>
<para>Complete device snapshot — one fetch from the inverter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Contains all inverter info, meter data, BMS data, and energy totals read in a single transaction batch. The <computeroutput>timestamp</computeroutput> records when the snapshot was taken. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
